    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;are the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, and<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac></mrow></munder><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi></math> is equal to",
